    <color r="255" g="255" b="255">
     <font name="Malgun Gothic" size="12" shadowx="2" shadowy="1" shadowa="50">Fun facts about the Porbeagle</font>
    </color>
   </cell>
   <p />
   <cell width="280" bgimg="ui/zoopedia/factBG.tga" padx="10">
    <p />
    <cell width="32" pady="10">
     <img src="ui/zoopedia/fact-bullet.tga" sx="0" sy="0" sw="32" sh="32" />
    </cell>
    <cell width="202" pady="10">
     <color r="255" g="255" b="255"><font name="Malgun Gothic" size="10">The maximum length of the Porbeagle is 11 ft.(3.50 m.)</font></color>
    </cell>
	<cell width="32" pady="10">
		<img src="ui/zoopedia/fact-bullet.tga" sx="0" sy="0" sw="32" sh="32" />
	</cell>    
    <cell width="202" pady="10">
     <color r="255" g="255" b="255"><font name="Malgun Gothic" size="10">The heaviest Porbeagle ever found was weight at about 550 lb. (250 kg.)</font></color>
    </cell>
	<cell width="32" pady="10">
		<img src="ui/zoopedia/fact-bullet.tga" sx="0" sy="0" sw="32" sh="32" />
	</cell>        
    <cell width="202" pady="10">
     <color r="255" g="255" b="255"><font name="Malgun Gothic" size="10">The Probeagle is seen as a potential danger to divers, because of their size and activities. But there are rarely attacks on humans or boats. This animal can be of harm to humans, but is not deadly.</font></color>
    </cell>
	<cell width="32" pady="10">
		<img src="ui/zoopedia/fact-bullet.tga" sx="0" sy="0" sw="32" sh="32" />
	</cell>    
    <cell width="202" pady="10">
     <color r="255" g="255" b="255"><font name="Malgun Gothic" size="10">Did you know that this Porbeagle is made by Dennis1991!</font></color>     
    </cell>
  </cell>
